# Public API

App code imports from `dashi`, except JSX types from `dashi/jsx-runtime`,
browser APIs from `dashi/client`, and CORS from `dashi/cors`. Do not
re-export JSX types from root `mod.ts`. Do not star-export internals. Do
not add a second specifier for something already on one entry.

Adding a published export is fine. Removing or renaming one is a breaking
0.x change.

## `dashi`

`cached`, `CacheStrategy`, `CacheConfig`, `CachedElement`, `status`,
`StatusElement`, `isStatusElement`, `client`, `patch`, `Patch`,
`RouteFragment`, `NavigationRoot`, `group`, `Group`, `serve`,
`staticFile`, `ParamsOf`, `Ctx`, `WrapperCtx`.

## `dashi/jsx-runtime`

`jsxImportSource` runtime and JSX types.

Values: `jsx`, `jsxTemplate`, `jsxAttr`, `jsxEscape`, `JsxRuntimeError`
(compiler runtime; `@internal`, still exported for `jsxImportSource`).

Types: `JSX` namespace, `Element`, `DashiNode`, `HTMLAttributes`,
`SVGAttributes` (siblings of the namespace, not nested in it).

## `dashi/client`

`navigate`

## `dashi/cors`

`cors`, `CorsOptions`, `CorsOrigin`
